  title: The Vesper Bell
  intro: 'Whispers in the castle say blood will be spilled when the Vesper Bell tolls.


    Find
    out who is in danger, who means them harm, and how. Then tell Captain Rowan at
    the guard post before the bell rings.


    <size=80%>[WASD] Move   [E] Interact  
    [J] Notepad   [Esc] Pause</size>'
  timeLimitSeconds: 900
  clockLabel: Until the Vesper Bell
