  reportPrompt: '"Speak plainly. Who is in danger, who means them harm, and how?"'
  partialMessage: The Captain frowns. "Your story does not add up. Bring me facts."
  wrongMessage: The Captain scowls. "Idle accusations waste my time. Bring me proof."
  winTitle: The murder is prevented
  winText: The guards reach the King in time. {victim} lives, and {culprit} is seized.
  loseTitle: The Vesper Bell tolls
  loseText: 'King Aldric raises his goblet for the toast and drinks deep. The wine
    is laced with nightshade.


    The King falls dead before the bell stops ringing,
    and Duke Colin is nowhere to be found.


    <b>Victim:</b> King Aldric    <b>Culprit:</b>
    Duke Colin    <b>Method:</b> Poisoned wine'
